# Tests

- Every behaviour in [docs/behaviour.md](../../docs/behaviour.md) gets an automated test that fails if that behaviour is missing.
- The automated tests cover every question in [The 18 test questions](../../docs/agreements.md#the-18-test-questions) and every urgent word in [Urgent messages](../../docs/agreements.md#urgent-messages).
- When an automated test fails, fix the project so it matches [docs/behaviour.md](../../docs/behaviour.md).
- Before a pull request is ready for review, run the automated tests in [run-checks.md](../commands/run-checks.md).
